WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.375
Where do customers get stuck? Start with one real customer question.

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:08.917
Capture the exact wording, when and where it appeared, and a source link.

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:13.750
For our fictional bike shop, the question is: Can I book a repair online?

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.250
Log one signal. Check that a teammate can trace it back to the source.
